# Guard file — Docusaurus docs site should NEVER be `databricks sync`'d.
# If you're trying to deploy the App, run the sync from the repo root so
# the repo-root .databricksignore takes effect (which excludes docs/).
#
# This `*` makes any `databricks sync` invoked from inside docs/ a no-op,
# preventing Docusaurus's package.json from being pushed into a
# Databricks Apps source folder (which would auto-detect the app as Node
# and break the build with `npm install` errors on transitive deps that
# the Databricks npm-proxy doesn't mirror).
*
